
load @cluesurf/base/code/proof/equal
  find equal

rule substitution
  head a
  take p
    like task
      take value, like a
  take x, like a
  take y, like a
  take proof
    like equal a x y
  take px
    call p
      bind value, read x
  like call p
    bind value, read y

test substitution
  take p
    like task
      take value, like a
  take x, like a
  take y, like a
  take proof
    like equal a x y
  take px
    call p
      bind value, read x
  fork case, read proof
    case refl
      send back, read px
